# Build-context allowlist for Dockerfile.native only (BuildKit uses `<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore` ahead of `.dockerignore`).
# Everything is excluded, then only what the builder stage COPYs is let back in; without this the daemon receives target/, .git/,
# .idea/, secrets/ ... for nothing, and any change in them would invalidate the (multi-minute) native-image layer.
*

!pom.xml
!config/native.env
!certs/smartkin
!src/main

# src/test stays out: the image build skips tests, so test sources are never compiled.
**/.DS_Store
